.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-episode-summary 1  "xil-episode-summary " 
.SH NAME
xil\-episode\-summary \- Write a one\-row\-per\-episode summary CSV from all parsed_<tag>.json files.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-episode\-summary\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-stdout\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a one\-row\-per\-episode summary CSV from all parsed_<tag>.json files.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Output CSV path (default: <workspace>/episode_summary.csv)
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Filter to a single show name, e.g. \*(AqTHE 413\*(Aq (case\-insensitive)
.TP
\fB\-\-stdout\fR
Write CSV to stdout — no banner, safe to pipe
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
